a aktif terhadap bacteroides fragilis dan kuman anaerob lainnya.</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n','','','0000-00-00 00:00:00',0,0,0,0,'','active','','standar',NULL,''),
